{'symbol': 'KSU', 'date': '2020-12-21 08:30:00', 'title': 'KANSAS CITY SOUTHERN ANNOUNCES 20TH ANNIVERSARY HOLIDAY EXPRESS FUNDRAISING RESULTS TO BENEFIT SALVATION ARMY IN 20 COMMUNITIES', 'text': 'KANSAS CITY, MO.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--KANSAS CITY SOUTHERN (KCS) (NYSE: KSU) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THE 20TH ANNIVERSARY KCS HOLIDAY EXPRESS PROGRAM IN PARTNERSHIP WITH THE SALVATION ARMY HAS RAISED OVER $277,000 TO BENEFIT THE SALVATION ARMY IN 20 COMMUNITIES ON ITS U.S. RAIL NETWORK. THOSE COMMUNITIES INCLUDE KANSAS CITY, JOPLIN AND MEXICO, MO.; BEAUMONT, CORPUS CHRISTI, DALLAS, HOUSTON, LAREDO AND PORT ARTHUR, TEXAS; BATON ROUGE, NEW ORLEANS, SHREVEPORT AND WESTLAKE, LA.; GULFPORT, JACKSON AND VI'}